# Greatest common divisor of two non-negative i32s by Euclid's algorithm.
# Rosetta Code: Greatest_common_divisor. Exercises: recursion, stack
# shuffling with swap and over. (basics.wack has the loop version.)

: gcd ( i32 i32 -- i32 )
  dup i32.eqz [ drop ] [ swap over i32.rem_u gcd ] if ;
test gcd : 48 18 gcd -> 6
test gcd : 18 48 gcd -> 6
test gcd : 0 7 gcd -> 7
test gcd : 7 0 gcd -> 7
test gcd : 17 5 gcd -> 1

: main ( -- )  "gcd(1071, 462) = " print 1071 462 gcd i32.to-str println ;
